;        being Doubled by script, during handling of Extra Gems.
;        * Payment of Gems for Fairy purchase now limited to 50 gems.
;        Player will get Charm point credit for up to 18 extra gems paid.
; v1.03. 12/19/03: color code tweaking.
; v1.04. 12/05/04: Changed to version 1.04. Renamed script label
;        FAIRY_END to GEMFAIRY_ENDING.  Renamed script label
;        FAIRY_PENALTY to GEMFAIRY_PENALTY.
